Arch Linux package of [Cosmalia](https://github.com/{{REPOSITORY}})
`{{TAG}}`: the opinionated XDG session (launcher, session entry and
systemd user units) for cosmic-comp-traffic + Noctalia.

### Install

```sh
gh release download {{TAG}} -R {{REPOSITORY}} -p '*.pkg.tar.zst*' -D /tmp/cosmalia-session
cd /tmp/cosmalia-session && sha256sum -c ./*.pkg.tar.zst.sha256
sudo pacman -U ./*.pkg.tar.zst
```

The package does not change the greeter default. To make it selectable
in a gtkgreet dropdown without changing the default:

```sh
sudo cosmalia-session-default --list
```

Then, optionally, make it the greeter default:

```sh
sudo cosmalia-session-default
```

Needs `cosmic-comp` (provided by cosmic-comp-traffic), `noctalia`,
`cosmic-settings-daemon`, `xdg-desktop-portal-gtk`, `xdg-desktop-portal-wlr`,
`polkit`, `gnome-keyring` and `wireplumber`. Optional: `cosmic-settings`,
`cosmic-screenshot`, `inotify-tools`, `polkit-gnome`, `zram-generator` and
`systemd-oomd`. The package replaces the old `cosmic-comp-traffic-session`
package.

### Revert

```sh
sudo pacman -R cosmalia-session
```
